      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like i'm being dramatic lol. my nurse told me last week that some swelling and tenderness is totally expected and that i shouldn't call unless i'm really bleeding or something. the pain is just a dull ache that's getting heavier, and the fever is only like 99.4. i really dont want to go back to the er and deal with the hospital drama again if i can help it. can i just take some extra ibuprofen and wait a day to see if it settles down?",
